  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix: BulkFile import (FileColumnMappingField) now treats an empty cell, including a whitespace-only cell, as null (unset) regardless of the column type or code conversion. Previously an empty cell in a code-conversion column or in a reference (Link) column was passed through as an empty string, which failed with FormatException in the import when the DB column is numeric, and an empty cell could not clear a reference on an Id-based update. Empty cells never produce a 'code not found' / 'cannot parse' error. No other changes; Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras and Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Designer stay at 0.12.0.",
